Task 1 — Dataset Quality Checker

তিনটি input নেবে:
- Fungal images
- Bacterial images
- Damaged images
Conditions:
- কোনো count negative হলে Invalid dataset
- সব count zero হলে Empty dataset
- অন্যথায় Dataset available
fungal_images = int (input ("Enter fungal images : "))
bacterial_images = int (input("Enter bacterial iamges : "))
damaged_images = int (input("Enter damaged iamges : "))

total_count = fungal_images + bacterial_images + damaged_images


if (fungal_images < 0 or bacterial_images < 0 or damaged_images < 0) :
    print ("Invalid dataset")
else :
    if (total_count == 0) :
        print ("Empty dataset")
    else :
        print ("Dataset available")
Task 2 — Dataset Size Classifier
valid_images = int (input("Enter valid images : "))

if valid_images < 0 :
    print ("Invalid")
elif (valid_images == 0) :
    print ("Empty")
elif 1 <= valid_images <= 100 :
    print ("Small")
elif (valid_images <= 500) :
    print ("Medium")
else :
    print ("Large")
Task 3 — Class Imbalance Detector
class1 = int (input ("Enter first class : "))
class2 = int (input ("Enter second class : "))

if (class1 < 0 or class2 < 0 ) :
    print ("Invalid")
elif (class1 == 0 or class2 == 0 ) :
    print ("class missing")
elif (class1 > 2*class2 or class2 > 2*class1) :
    print ("imbalance warning")
else :
    print ("Balanced dataset")
